Package: pve-ups-panel
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-manager (>= 7.0), nut-client, sudo, python3, libjson-perl, librrds-perl
Recommends: nut-server
Description: UPS management panel for Proxmox VE
 Adds a full UPS management interface to the Proxmox VE node page via
 NUT (Network UPS Tools). Provides seven sub-tabs covering all aspects
 of UPS monitoring and management.
 .
 Features:
  - Overview: live dashboard with battery charge, load, runtime gauges
    and full device detail cards; NUT setup wizard
  - Device Management: add/edit/delete NUT devices, service control
  - History: RRD trend charts for charge, load, voltage, runtime
  - Battery Health: health assessment, quick/full battery test
  - Shutdown Rules: per-VM/CT ordered shutdown, recovery strategy
  - Notifications: PVE notification target routing per UPS event
  - Logs: UPS event log viewer with clear function
  - i18n: 31 languages (zh_TW, zh_CN, de, fr, es, it, ja, ko, and more)
